WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.554 --> 00:00:02.721
This is AssetPulse:

2
00:00:02.726 --> 00:00:05.605
a real-time demo for keeping IV pumps

3
00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.128
where a hospital needs them.

4
00:00:08.344 --> 00:00:10.693
All day, nurses move pumps from the

5
00:00:10.693 --> 00:00:13.546
clean utility room into patient rooms,

6
00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:16.522
and the clean shelf quietly runs low.

7
00:00:17.745 --> 00:00:19.336
AssetPulse catches that,

8
00:00:19.336 --> 00:00:20.548
the moment it happens,

9
00:00:20.548 --> 00:00:23.359
and pages a technician automatically.

10
00:00:24.586 --> 00:00:26.897
A TypeScript server holds the floor's state

11
00:00:26.897 --> 00:00:30.230
and streams every change over WebSockets.

12
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.313
The control panel is React.

13
00:00:32.313 --> 00:00:34.460
Every event lands in Snowflake,

14
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.223
and it all runs on Azure.

15
00:00:37.462 --> 00:00:39.204
And that phone isn't a mock-up or

16
00:00:39.204 --> 00:00:41.667
an emulator. It's the real tech app,

17
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.091
built with Expo and React Native,

18
00:00:44.091 --> 00:00:45.581
compiled for the web,

19
00:00:45.581 --> 00:00:47.622
and running live on its own connection.

20
00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:49.570
Here's the loop.

21
00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:52.386
Drag three pumps off the clean shelf

22
00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:54.035
and into patient rooms.

23
00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.426
The shelf hits its minimum,

24
00:00:56.426 --> 00:00:57.916
a work order opens,

25
00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:00.488
and Joe's phone buzzes with a notification.

26
00:01:00.967 --> 00:01:01.838
He taps it,

27
00:01:01.838 --> 00:01:03.038
accepts the order,

28
00:01:03.038 --> 00:01:06.333
restocks, and marks three pumps delivered.

29
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:08.879
The shelf refills instantly.

30
00:01:09.366 --> 00:01:12.270
Insights shows how quickly Joe responded.

31
00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:15.397
And you can ask Snowflake Cortex in plain English.

32
00:01:19.359 --> 00:01:21.930
How many pumps were delivered? Three.

33
00:01:23.535 --> 00:01:26.598
It's live at assetpulse.proswitch.ai

34
00:01:27.849 --> 00:01:29.107
Try it yourself.
